{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:304da4567c421ecd627ec6da7bd5f1411febdd49e6f562d499874c5543652eb2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:661ccf74cd2582816f150ad2a08b0e4e8b42729f601c62422fcb48e32a40ed95",
      "text": "惊喜礼物",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e15f8953e2c2443c9d2216b9dcffcd03691179543dd2f006990ab8e87c7f954",
      "text": "某天录制的间隙，桐生去向前来录影的熟人师父打招呼，收到了提前给的生日礼物。在回忆着这一年的点滴回到休息室后，不知为何，九郎却让他坐在那里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3720424cd878fc534be685ac11f2e52f9750f6fa248fd9e58880cb899350e61b",
      "text": "看来猫柳先生\n对今天的生日会非常开心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:458394c262bac4c8b9c5ab0bb32f550362c192f4a1ce3284fe38019045566220",
      "text": "说的也是呢。为了不辜负那份期待，\n必须做好万全准备才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf528b9c0956e9538e79dc48164c337b64bc0634d8cf042d5685cbf72b40d0ee",
      "text": "是的。蛋糕和喜欢的食物，\n还有礼物的准备都万无一失了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15af99c2c17c6962f30aa8c92bd0836e08436569c9dae3c960a0d8472a665d51",
      "text": "他一定会高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83e18cd7b48b2652296cff719a0d5b123612b81f501fb026ef2cbb0d5b6b601f",
      "text": "嗯。今天希望能为猫柳先生好好盛大庆祝一番。\n华村先生也请做好准备！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73327e94e1b00b54585419cf353198396918726c0d8521fb58a43da5cb3df649",
      "text": "今天早上收到的视频，\n真是吓了吾辈一跳喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9b35500499d96ada8f151683da35f7aaf7507d0aa59c1418e6a2c663592d5c3",
      "text": "不仅有邀请函，竟然还有惊喜，\n完全没想到喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:155387a687f3223a149726fcc0f51cf91259cd8248a83992be18fdbc282f05fb",
      "text": "小伙子，惊喜可不一定只有一次哦。\n不管来多少次都很棒对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:addfa595a8d73cef45cc9af098323a43b67c4a03eab988e6f1157fda724759a1",
      "text": "喵？难道说，待会儿还可能会有\n惊喜喵！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8948a4b5551e4d910e1fb36cc9c53174721607f93b55a904f5d579dc64925233",
      "text": "哎呀，谁知道呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb9f8eaec50630771ff68bc070cc372ec7159bc9b11870669cc35b66ca648124",
      "text": "谢谢你们的邀请函喵！\n里面的内容是九郎君写的喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:945f03fde71520173637f722c2b2e116e588e83a8f9fd9b61a6726c761e47224",
      "text": "是的，是我写的。\n您是怎么看出来的呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6feb8a26575c443c18634122303599a07adaf65c8b0ac2d2d964cedfbcf3b90c",
      "text": "那些时令问候啦喵。所以立刻就\n看出是九郎君写的了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4f04b4ef37a3fc51016d77f4a982e62216993bbbe8ade94e41bfee836b7e071",
      "text": "虽然华村先生也说写得太死板了，\n但这可是必要的礼仪。不写可不行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_017kir_2_1_2_017_12:1_2_017_12_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2ccf0ac0e2d4c038386879e76f2afcc571f37af1466952bfe4c00cd8e299970",
      "text": "喵哈哈哈！非常具有九郎君风格的邀请函，\n真是太谢谢了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
